OL,3,GNEWSAGreens face conference centre ban
OL,4,Aover Zionism motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Green Party of England and Wales
OL,7,Fcould be barred from holding future
OL,8,Fconferences at the Brighton Centre
OL,9,Fafter the party passed a motion
OL,10,Fdeclaring Zionism was racism.
OL,12,FThe leader of Brighton & Hove City
OL,13,FCouncil (BHCC), Labour's Bella Sankey,
OL,14,Fsaid she was "deeply concerned at the
OL,15,Fprospect of the Green Party returning
OL,16,Fto Brighton for future conferences".
OL,18,FShe claimed the motion was "divisive,
OL,19,Fdiscriminatory and wrong" and was not
OL,20,Fcompatible with Brighton & Hove's
OL,21,Fcommitments to be a welcoming and
OL,22,Finclusive city.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
