OL,3,GNEWSAGreens face conference centre ban
OL,4,Aover Zionism motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FZack Polanski, the Green Party leader,
OL,7,Fsaid he would "not accept any
OL,8,Fexclusion, or refusal to engage with
OL,9,Fanyone, because of the religious or
OL,10,Fcommunal body they are part of".
